    "body": "## Problem\r\nFloat border highlight groups (FloatBorder, FloatTitle and FloatFooter) fall back to Normal background highlight if no background color set.\r\n\r\n## Solution\r\nCombine border colors with window-local Normal highlight.\r\n\r\nFix #38330",
