            "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
            "body": "Fixed the tests. I added predefined group 31 to screen.lua to use for borders instead of group 2. There is an option to modify group 2 instead, but it's also used for non-border-related things like window separators. I think it's clearer to add new groups for the changed highlight instead of modifying an existing one and then updating all other affected places.\r\n\r\n> sorry, what do you mean 😅\r\n\r\nIt's okay, I wasn't clear. What I meant is that there might be a quirk in how the highlighting works that I'm not aware of - in that case I may need to adjust the patch, and then the tests might also need to be updated again after that.",
